  "today": "2026-10-07",
  "allowlist": {
    "body-hard-line-break": "Python trims all trailing whitespace from body lines, which deletes Markdown hard line breaks (two or more spaces before a line ending) and changes how the note renders. TypeScript keeps a final run of two or more spaces on a body line that has content (kpeez/llmos#44). The texts must differ only in those runs.",
    "health-qmd-unembedded": "health gained qmd_unembedded (documents still needing embedding) when the Stop hook stopped embedding; the Python health has no such field. It is null without qmd.",
